On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Archmage]Drake is in Linate village! Hurry!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Archmage]Drake is in Raive village! Hurry!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "I wondered who they would send, and its you! That's odd. <selfname> has come to me"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "By the way, why so late! Move it! The spirit is crying! Take care of the [Lich] and gather the [Remains of the Fallen Warrior]!\n\nCollect the Soldier's article following the order of [Elder Wizard] Drake."

On in_progress
    Say "Still here? You prick ... Move it quickly!"

On claimable
    Show quest "Good job, you have brought enough. I will reward you for b on time."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "Find your [Captain] and deliver this remains to him, he should know what to do."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "My role is over. Deliver this to [Eslant Wise Man]Agata."
